    "userFeedback": {
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "comment": "Prevent walking to the lower platform edge and dashing up; force jumping from the spring, then bank for Base."
    },
    "designNotes": "Approved Base adaptation: no dash, super, hyper or wallbounce is needed or available. The short lower weight pocket is covered by a high bridge with a thorned underside, so its edge cannot become a second launch toward the exit. The bridge lies above ordinary jump height from the resting recoil support; the spring jump is required by the geometry. The overhead ceiling has been opened to fit a normal lifted jump.",
